  "description": "The Kent T29 is designed for thrill-seekers who want to conquer their local trails. With its lightweight aluminum hardtail frame, this bike offers the perfect balance of strength and agility. The front suspension fork provides a smooth ride on tough trails, so you can focus on the adventure ahead. Front & rear linear side pull brakes provide substantial stopping power and let you stop on a dime. The 21 speed drivetrain and easy to use twist shifters give you the ability to smoothly shift gears and tackle any climb. This bike is equipped with lightweight alloy wheels, which offer reduced weight and offer rust resistance. The height adjustable saddle ensures a comfortable fit, while the knobby mountain bike tires provide unbeatable traction on all types of terrain. Hit the trails on this sleek 29\" mountain bike!",
